* Schematic-side reference for LVS of the minimum-size per-cell comparator.
.subckt comparator_min sample ramp bias dout vdd vss
XINP left sample tail vss nfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=1u nf=1 m=1
XINN outa ramp tail vss nfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=1u nf=1 m=1
XLOADD left left vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=2u nf=1 m=1
XLOADM outa left vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=2u nf=1 m=1
XTAIL tail bias vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.5u W=1u nf=1 m=1
XBUF1 outb outa vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=0.5u nf=1 m=1
XBUF2 outb outa vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=1u nf=1 m=1
XBUF3 dout outb vss vss nfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=1u nf=1 m=1
XBUF4 dout outb vdd vdd pfet_03v3 L=0.28u W=2u nf=1 m=1
.ends comparator_min
